title: "GATEBench: benchmarking large language models on the Graduate Aptitude Test in Engineering"
abstract: >-
  Code, extracted question bank, official answer keys and full model responses
  for a benchmark of seven frontier large language models on six GATE 2025 and
  2026 test papers.
